"features":{"title":"Everything You Need","subtitle":"From intelligent compression to one-click cloud upload — MoliTutu handles the entire workflow.","compression":{"title":"Smart Compression","desc":"Intelligent algorithms reduce file size by up to 80% without perceptible quality loss. Supports lossy and lossless modes."},"upload":{"title":"R2 Upload","desc":"Seamless integration with Cloudflare R2. Configure once, upload instantly. Automatic public URL generation."},"privacy":{"title":"Privacy First","desc":"All processing runs locally on your machine. Your images go directly to your own R2 bucket. We never see your data."},"proxy":{"title":"Local API Proxy","desc":"Built-in HTTP server for programmatic uploads. Integrate MoliTutu into your scripts, CI/CD, or custom workflows."}},
