"why":{"title":"Why MoliTutu?","subtitle":"Built different. No subscriptions. No cloud dependency. Just a tool that respects your privacy and productivity.","pillar1":{"title":"Lightning Fast","desc":"Process ~50 images per second with parallel compression pipelines. No waiting, no queuing."},"pillar2":{"title":"Lossless Quality","desc":"Intelligent algorithms preserve visual fidelity while dramatically reducing file size."},"pillar3":{"title":"100% Private","desc":"Everything runs locally. No data ever touches our servers. Your images stay yours."},"pillar4":{"title":"Zero Config","desc":"Download, launch, and go. Minimal setup with sensible defaults that just work."}},
